These icons come from the Open RuneLite client source (runelite-client resources) and keep
its BSD 2-Clause license, reproduced in LICENSE next to this file:
config_icon, config_icon_lg, config_back_icon, config_edit_icon, refresh, star_on, profile_icon
(plugins/config); runelite_16, runelite_128, open, open_rs (ui); search, error (ui/components);
devtools_icon (plugins/devtools); collapsed, expanded (plugins/loottracker).

2026-10-29 shared egui continuation: runescape.ttf, runescape_bold.ttf and
runescape_small.ttf are copied unchanged from the pinned client's ui resources,
under the same repository BSD 2-Clause LICENSE reproduced here. No reference
checkout is loaded by the application. star_on.png is recolored with source
ColorScheme.GREEN. star_off.png uses source grayscale/luminance 0.77.
switch_on.png and switch_off.png derive from ui/components/switcher_on.png using
the source ToggleButton recolor/flip/luminance operations (BRAND_ORANGE; 0.61).
The diagnostic tools/sidebar/RuneLiteSidebarMetrics.java reproduces these
transformations. Exact source and owned hashes are in
../../../../docs/reference/SIDEBAR-LIFECYCLE-EVIDENCE-2026-10-29.json.
